test_req_file.py is pip's test file for its requirements file parser, copied unchanged as test
data on 24 November 2026 from https://github.com/pypa/pip at commit
5b4d45102eb54ceb77740f83c80ef09017565a67, path tests/unit/test_req_file.py. Its inputs and what
it expects are transcribed into the tests of src/lockfiles/requirements.rs, each with the line it
comes from. The file is read as data and never run.

